THIRD-PARTY DATA AND IMAGERY

This license covers the source code only.

- Orbital elements come from CelesTrak (https://celestrak.org), which publishes
  them from the U.S. Space Force's 18th Space Defense Squadron. They are
  downloaded under CelesTrak's usage policy (at most one download per update)
  and are not covered by this license. Credit to CelesTrak must be kept in any
  copy or derivative of this project that shows the data.

- The Earth textures in public/textures/ are derived from NASA's Blue Marble
  Next Generation and Black Marble imagery (NASA Earth Observatory), which are
  in the public domain. NASA asks to be credited as the source.
